### 查询所有商品
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products

### 查询单个商品
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/1

### 新增商品
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP测试商品",
  "description": "通过 IDEA HTTP Client 新增",
  "price": 6.50,
  "stock": 80,
  "status": "ON_SALE"
}

### 修改商品
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "修改后的商品",
  "description": "通过 IDEA HTTP Client 修改",
  "price": 7.20,
  "stock": 60,
  "status": "ON_SALE"
}

### 删除商品
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/products/1

### 无效输入：名称为空、价格和库存为负数（预期 400）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "description": "校验测试",
  "price": -1,
  "stock": -2,
  "status": "ON_SALE"
}

### 查询不存在的商品（预期 404）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/99999

### 按名称搜索商品
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/search?name=测试